      <title>WordPress &#34;Import and Export Users and Customers&#34; Plugin Privilege Escalation (CVE-2026-3629)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/web/2026-07-05_cve-2026-3629-wordpress-privilege-escalation/</link>
